  "notes": "Surmai (Mantine-based) travel board. Distinctive slate-blue (#6b7a99) icon rail with white active tile; light grey canvas with white 8px-radius outlined cards; stat cards use label-left/value-right rows with tiny grey 'Avg.:' sub-lines and a hairline divider before totals. Expense card has a centered 'Totals per Currency' divider label. Year strip is fixed-by-designer years; selection persists in URL (?year=2025). Footer and sidebar are fixed, so in the full-page capture they overlay content at y 867-900. Map is plain Leaflet OSM default with default blue markers."
